{
  "name": "settle",
  "order": 3,
  "title": "a second session settles a criterion; the builder only self-checks; the operator's criterion stays open",
  "label": "v4 AC-81 (settle)",
  "description": "Missions v4 S-33, AC-81. A v4 mission is seeded: step 1 was built by A (a `session` link) and carries three criteria (two for a second session, one for the operator); B is attached as a worker. B settles criterion 1 (stamped with B and the evidence), tries it a second time (the first settlement stands) and tries the operator's criterion (refused). A, the builder, then calls the same verb on criterion 2: it is a labelled self-check, never proof, and the criterion stays open. The grade reads the criteria: `settled` only on criterion 1 and by B, `selfCheck` only on criterion 2 and by A, nothing on the operator's.",
  "agents": ["A", "B"],
  "phases": [
    {
      "seedV4": {
        "slug": "notes-export",
        "title": "Notes export",
        "doneWhen": "The notes export ships",
        "steps": [
          {
            "title": "Write the CSV writer",
            "startedAt": "now",
            "links": [
              {
                "kind": "session",
                "ref": "{{session.A}}"
              }
            ],
            "acs": [
              {
                "text": "The writer emits one row per board"
              },
              {
                "text": "The writer rejects an empty board"
              },
              {
                "text": "The flag text reads well",
                "by": "operator"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sessions": [
          {
            "id": "{{session.A}}",
            "role": "leads"
          },
          {
            "id": "{{session.B}}",
            "role": "worked"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "agent": "B",
      "prompt": "1. mcp__harnu__mission_settle_ac with folder=\"{{folder}}\", missionId=\"{{m.notes-export.id}}\", sessionId=\"{{self}}\", stepId=\"stp-1\", criterionId=\"ac-1\", evidence=\"Ran it on two boards: two rows each.\".\n2. The same call again, with evidence=\"Second look, same result.\" (it is refused: the first settlement stands).\n3. mcp__harnu__mission_settle_ac with the same folder, missionId and sessionId, stepId=\"stp-1\", criterionId=\"ac-3\", evidence=\"Read the help text.\" (it is refused: the operator settles that one)."
    },
    {
      "agent": "A",
      "prompt": "1. mcp__harnu__mission_settle_ac with folder=\"{{folder}}\", missionId=\"{{m.notes-export.id}}\", sessionId=\"{{self}}\", stepId=\"stp-1\", criterionId=\"ac-2\", evidence=\"Ran it: an empty board is rejected.\"."
    }
  ],
  "assert": [
    {
      "missionCount": 1
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "a second session settled criterion 1",
      "path": "acs.0.settled.by",
      "equals": "{{session.B}}"
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "with its evidence, the first one",
      "path": "acs.0.settled.evidence",
      "equals": "Ran it on two boards: two rows each."
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "a settled criterion carries no self-check",
      "path": "acs.0.selfCheck",
      "exists": false
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "the builder did not settle criterion 2",
      "path": "acs.1.settled",
      "exists": false
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "the builder's check is labelled, with its author",
      "path": "acs.1.selfCheck.by",
      "equals": "{{session.A}}"
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "path": "acs.1.selfCheck.evidence",
      "equals": "Ran it: an empty board is rejected."
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "label": "the operator's criterion stays open",
      "path": "acs.2.settled",
      "exists": false
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "step": "id:stp-1",
      "path": "acs.2.selfCheck",
      "exists": false
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "label": "no criterion is settled by the builder",
      "anyCriterion": {
        "settled": {
          "by": "{{session.A}}"
        }
      },
      "present": false
    },
    {
      "mission": "notes-export",
      "label": "exactly one criterion is settled",
      "criterionCount": {
        "settled": {
          "$exists": true
        }
      },
      "equals": 1
    }
  ],
  "breaks": [
    {
      "name": "builder-settled-its-own",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "unset": "acs.1.selfCheck"
        },
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "set": {
            "acs.1.settled": {
              "at": "2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z",
              "by": "{{session.A}}",
              "evidence": "mine"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "self-check-promoted-to-proof",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "set": {
            "acs.1.settled": {
              "at": "2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z",
              "by": "{{session.B}}",
              "evidence": "x"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "settlement-overwritten",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "set": {
            "acs.0.settled.evidence": "Second look, same result."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "operator-criterion-settled",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "set": {
            "acs.2.settled": {
              "at": "2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z",
              "by": "{{session.B}}",
              "evidence": "x"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "settled-by-the-builder",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "set": {
            "acs.0.settled.by": "{{session.A}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing-settled",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "unset": "acs.0.settled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "no-self-check",
      "mutate": [
        {
          "mission": "notes-export",
          "step": "id:stp-1",
          "unset": "acs.1.selfCheck"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
